n=A.aqh("A smart home automation system that enables wireless control of household appliances and real-time monitoring of environmental conditions. Built using Android, Arduino, and NodeMCU, the system allows users to control devices like lights, fans, and doors via a mobile app, while sensors detect motion, fire, smoke, and light levels to enhance home security and automation. The project was demonstrated through a realistic miniature house model simulating a fully connected smart home.",A.b(["SMART DEVICE AUTOMATION","Remotely control home appliances like lights, fans, and doors via an Android app","Real-time switching using Wi-Fi-based communication through NodeMCU","","INTELLIGENT SECURITY MONITORING","Detects unauthorized motion using PIR sensors for intrusion alerting","Integrated fire and smoke sensors for proactive hazard detection and safety","Ultrasonic sensor monitors distance for real-time object detection or doorway control","","AUTOMATED ACCESS CONTROL","Servo motor-based smart door lock system controllable via mobile","Enables remote and touchless entry management for enhanced convenience","","USER-FRIENDLY AND REALISTIC SIMULATION","Built and tested on a miniature house model simulating a real home setup","Demonstrated seamless integration of multiple IoT modules working in sync","","LOW-LATENCY CONNECTION","Instant feedback and control using efficient Wi-Fi protocol via NodeMCU","Ensures reliable performance even with multiple simultaneous device interactions"],o),"assets/images/home_automation_icon.png",["assets/images/home_model_1.jpeg","assets/images/home_model_2.jpeg","assets/images/home_model_3.jpeg"],["assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/signup.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/login.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/home_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/light_control.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/fan_control.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/sensor_control.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/light_history.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/home_automation/pir_history.jpg"],n,"Home Automation System")
q=A.b(["Android","MySQL","REST APIs"],o)
q=A.aqh("EduCom is an Android app that helps students strengthen weak subjects through peer support. It enables users to connect with classmates, ask questions anonymously, and share study materials or class notes. Ideal for students who miss lectures or feel hesitant to approach faculty, EduCom also fosters self-confidence and communication skills through academic collaboration.",A.b(["PROFILE CREATION & SUBJECT TAGGING","Add academic year, branch, and subjects you're strong or weak in","Feed is personalized based on weak subjects","","INTELLIGENT MATCHMAKING SYSTEM","Automatically shows students whose strengths match your weak areas","Designed like a dating app concept \u2014 but for study collaboration","","ANONYMOUS QUESTION POSTING","Ask questions without revealing identity","Get help without hesitation","","DIRECT CHAT AND CONNECTIVITY","One-to-one communication with matched peers","Share doubts, ideas, or tips easily","","STUDY MATERIAL SHARING","Upload class notes or helpful resources","Download shared content by others","","ENHANCES CONFIDENCE & COMMUNICATION","Encourages teamwork and open academic discussions","Useful for students who miss classes or hesitate to approach teachers"],o),"assets/images/educom_icon.png",null,["assets/images/screenshots/educom/login.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/educom/register.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/educom/home_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/educom/chat_section.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/educom/chat_page.jpg","assets/images/screenshots/educom/profile_page_more.jpg"],q,"EduCom - Smart Education")
